WEBVTT

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.950
Are you still in love with Sempai?

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.470
I-I...

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:20.280
Sorry, I didn't mean to ask
such a personal question.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:24.630
Oh, no, I... I'm already...

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:28.960
Me... On top of being rejected, she
completely hates me now.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.920
And yet I still love her.
I'm a true idiot, huh?

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.380
No...

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.460
You're not...

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.830
Maybe I do get off on unrequited love.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.310
That's not true.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:51.970
Manjome-san?

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:53.530
Huh?

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.820
Huh? What?

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:00.590
Oh man. Sorry.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:17.000
Look at us!

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:49.150
I'm gonna stop at the next service area.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.350
What? We just took a break.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.490
I forgot to get gas.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.180
What gives, man?

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:00.140
I let you come along.
You need to keep it together.

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:04.870
What?! "Let you"? I'm driving <i>you!</i>

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.550
You have some nerve!

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:09.280
You're only driving because <i>you</i>
wanted to come too!

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.850
What?!

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:13.930
Now, now, no bickering.

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:18.100
It's all right, Okudaira-san.
Let's take our time.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.760
Hey, look at that.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:21.710
What is it?

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:29.920
Mt. Fuji!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.780
Nice to see you again, Auntie.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:52.330
Welcome, Kyoko-chan.
I've been expecting you.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.510
Hey.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:54.990
Ko-chan!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.260
This is Ko Sawanai-san.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:58.680
Hello.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:00.900
Hello!

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:03.470
This is Aunt Hanae.

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:06.560
Her older sister is Ko-chan's mother.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.370
Sorry,

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:12.580
my sister had something come up at the
last minute, so I came in her place.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:12.580
<i>Wow, so that's the legendary fiancé.</i>

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.350
So he does exist.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.180
Nice to meet you.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:18.910
I'm Akira Okudaira's older brother.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.700
Nice to meet you.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:24.110
Wait, actually, we've met before.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:24.820
Huh?

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.030
You remember that day...

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:35.950
OK, come on in. I'll give you the grand tour.

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.470
This is the dining room.
The living room is over here.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.640
You can use this bedroom

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.890
and this one.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:49.200
Let me know if you need anything at all.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.310
Ah! A tennis court!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.990
Wow!

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:53.880
Wanna play?

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:55.630
Heck yeah! Right?

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.580
Kyoko-chan drew that.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.620
It's very nice.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:32.720
Hey, hey! She's wiping the
court with you, Pon-chan!

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.350
Shut up!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.300
You can do it, Pon-chan!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.300
Just shut up and watch!

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:39.420
You can do whatever you
put your mind to, Yoko!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:07.280
Umm... Nice shot.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.450
Nope, that was terrible.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.410
Sorry.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:18.440
You got stuck with me
as soon as you arrive.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.500
Nah.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:23.750
I'd never get a chance to
play golf, otherwise.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.380
So, about your little sister...

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:31.330
Yeah?

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:34.400
I know I invited her to that
group date before, but...

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:38.620
I'm not going to do it again, so
please don't worry about it.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:39.950
Oh.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.840
Thanks.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:49.390
You really take good care
of your sister, huh?

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:52.670
I think I take it too far sometimes, though.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.890
Oh, is that so?

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:59.210
I guess you can't help but worry.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:01.520
Yeah, well...

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:04.760
Even if <i>you</i> don't invite her,

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:10.430
someone else is probably
gonna show up, so...

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:22.410
I know exactly what you mean.

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:27.410
Hiking Trail

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.920
I got lost in there once when I was a kid.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.760
What? In there?

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.150
This place is really scary, don't you think?

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.530
Yeah.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:37.310
I was so scared, and wandering
through the woods...

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:40.140
By the time I noticed, I was alongside
a mountain stream.

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:43.810
I just sat there and cried my eyes out.

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:49.250
Ko-chan was the one who found me.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:53.390
Ah! What an incredibly romantic story!

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:55.430
I'm so jealous!

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:59.560
All right. Since we're here, let's
make a pilgrimage to that spot!

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:00.970
Yeah! That's a great idea!

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:01.930
Let's go!

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.810
Umm, there's really nothing there...

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.010
Don't worry about it!

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:07.870
It's the act of going there that counts.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.050
Exactly!

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:18.130
You can slip easily here,
so walk down slowly.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.360
Right-o.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.440
OK.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:26.150
Be careful, Achan.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.310
OK.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:33.710
Are you all right?

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:35.410
S-Sorry!

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:43.040
Ow...

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.750
Would it kill one of you to help me?!

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:48.200
S-Sorry. Are you OK?

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.980
Damn you... Don't laugh!

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:53.500
Hold it right there, you two!

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:55.060
This isn't Pon-chan's day, huh?

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.400
It sure isn't.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:05.800
It's so cool and refreshing in the mountains.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:09.490
Yeah. I'm not sweaty at all now.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.940
Oh, so this is it.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:22.810
Wah! Wah! I'm lost!

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:24.790
Kyoko, I've come to save you!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.230
Oh, Ko-chan!

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:27.060
Kyoko!

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.250
You don't have to reenact it, geez!

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:27.990
Ko-chan!

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:28.770
Kyoko!

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:29.790
Ko-chan!

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:30.470
Kyoko!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.600
What is all this?!

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:31.250
Ko-chan!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:31.930
Kyoko!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.200
Come on!

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:32.780
Ko-chan!

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:33.490
Kyoko!

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:35.240
Ko-chan!

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:46.690
It's so cold.

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:50.640
Wow, it is.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.590
Right?

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.980
You really don't have to help.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:04.250
It's OK. This is nothing.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:09.500
Oh, so, that tall girl, umm,
what's her name...

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.120
Manjome-san?

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:14.150
She was impressed by your drawing.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.300
Yeah?

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:27.940
Ah...

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.210
Dinner was delicious,

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:32.560
the bath was relaxing...

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:35.360
I've died and gone to heaven!

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.370
You're so silly, Achan.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.610
Evenin', girls!

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:43.550
What's up?

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:46.670
Let's tell ghost stories.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.490
Huh?

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:51.240
No, no! We're no good at those.

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:52.160
Right, Fumi-chan?

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:54.310
That sounds like fun.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:58.760
OK, we'll go clockwise starting from Yassan.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.040
H-Hey!

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.700
Ever heard of the Gap Woman?

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.010
Her name alone creeps me out!

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.590
Shall I turn off the lights?

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:09.330
Ah! Don't!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.470
You're all alone in your room...

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:15.010
You feel like someone's looking at you...

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:17.700
Stop, stop!

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:20.430
And then you look in the gap between
your dressers, and...

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.620
Camping?!

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:38.430
Yeah. Do you remember the 3-way junction
on the hiking path yesterday?

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.060
There's a campground down
the path from there.

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:42.970
Since we're all here, wanna camp out?

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.840
Yes, yes!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.840
Let's do it!

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.350
It's dangerous for girls to go alone,

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.100
so will you two boys please join them?

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.050
Sure.

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:52.620
I've never gone camping before!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.050
When I think of camping, I picture...

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:56.590
Making our own campfire...

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.280
Cooking our meals on it...

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:01.010
And it goes without saying,
we'll be making curry!

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:04.870
Geez. All you think about is food.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.090
What?

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:08.300
Whatever, I just won't give you any.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.750
Now why would you do that?!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:13.240
Now, now, no bickering.

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:21.080
Main Office

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.600
I-It's done, right?

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:49.410
Nope. The timer hasn't chimed yet.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:53.690
Gah! I can't wait any longer!

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.560
It chimed!

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:05.560
Oh... It smells so great...

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.910
OK, I'm gonna serve it.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.090
Get your plates ready!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.130
Let's eat!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:25.750
It's...

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:26.760
It's good!

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.030
Friggin' delicious!

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:33.310
Hey, you made that food yourselves.
How about some modesty?

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:36.570
But it really is good. Don't you think?

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:37.790
Yeah.

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.350
I'm jealous, Ikumi-san.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:42.750
You've got a fiancé with a summer home

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:44.640
in such a great place!

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:49.500
That path connects to the hiking
trail we walked yesterday, right?

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.470
Yep.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:55.440
Let's do a test of courage once it gets dark!

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:56.200
Huh?

00:13:56.200 --> 00:14:00.260
Remember all those lilies on
the bed of that stream?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:02.430
We'll split into groups of
two and go pick them.

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:04.310
No! No frigging way!

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.560
I told you, we're not good at those things!

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:07.470
Right?

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.010
Ikumi-san?!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.780
Sounds like fun!

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:13.700
What?!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:16.030
So you went to that spot?

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:17.160
Yeah.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.070
OK, I'll prepare the lots
so we can draw teams.

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:22.280
We'll need to borrow paper and markers.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:24.010
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:25.300
Yeah!

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:50.410
Kyoko!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.730
Ko-chan, are you mad at me?

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.170
Why would I be?

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:14.080
You fell because you were carrying
me on your back, didn't you?

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:15.600
Yeah.

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.340
Does it hurt?

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.090
It hurts.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:22.070
I hurt because of you.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:26.010
I'm sorry.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:27.340
I'm just kidding.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.750
Don't cry! Smile!

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:41.340
Smile, Kyoko.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.570
On the count of two...

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:52.930
One, two!

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:54.260
Red.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:56.050
Oh, that's me.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.110
Green...

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:58.080
Green.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.050
Yellow.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:04.240
Oh, that's me.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:06.510
I guess Pon-chan has blue, then?

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:09.230
Aww, she won't get scared at all.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.640
Wanna switch for Achan?

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:14.190
No! Anyone but Yassan!

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:22.430
Be careful. We're almost at the spot
where Pon-chan fell yesterday.

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.500
OK.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.480
Your drawing...

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.930
...was great. Of the white birch tree.

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:33.960
It was just so...

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:42.120
I've been in the art club
since middle school.

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:48.350
And that's when I fell for Sempai.

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:59.270
But by then, she was already...

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:04.270
Umm, thank you.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:08.910
For... everything.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.640
Oh, this is it.

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:27.600
It's amazing that Fumi-chan
and Kyoko made it this far.

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:33.550
I never would have expected you to
be such a fraidy cat, Okudaira-san.

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:35.290
What's that supposed to mean?

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:37.750
I'm a girl too!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:39.940
Sorry, sorry. That's not what I meant.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:45.150
If it was me that got lost
here, I'd just be so...

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:50.850
Oh, so you heard about
when Kyoko got lost.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.520
Oh, yeah.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:57.170
Kyoko's in love with someone, huh?

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:01.830
I know about it.

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:07.150
Oh, well, this stays between us,

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.810
but Ikumi-san got turned down already.

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:12.800
Thank you.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.480
I want

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.360
to be that person.

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:37.410
They look great.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:38.070
Yeah.

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:39.730
Huh? What is it?!

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:42.590
C'mon! Out with it, Mogi!

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:45.480
When you say "Oniisan," you're referring
to Okudaira-san's brother, right?!

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.810
What's going on?

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.950
Motegi-san has fallen...

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.010
...for your brother!

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:51.550
Huh?

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:55.950
I-I just thought that he's kinda cool.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:57.390
What?!

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.290
See, she said it!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:02.730
What are your thoughts as
her future sister-in-law?

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.250
U-Umm...

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:09.530
I don't know what you see in him.

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:11.700
Huh? But he's cool!

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:32.580
They all have someone they like, huh?

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:47.240
I wonder if I'll fall for someone too

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:50.330
and end up crying like Fumi-chan.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:12.130
There was some food in the fridge, huh?

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:12.910
Yeah.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.730
Achan, this is incredible...

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:22.770
Hmm?

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:24.830
The sky is beautiful!

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:35.240
Amazing... Isn't it amazing?

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.830
Yeah, it is.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:03.490
The two of us stayed up
late outside that night

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:08.550
and caught colds together.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.910
A Midsummer Night's Dream

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.820
See you next time.
